{"id":"mtk-b7-data","title":"Piktogram dan Diagram Batang","subject":"matematika","fase":["B"],"kelas":[3,4],"elemen":["Analisis Data dan Peluang"],"packId":"mtk-b7","summary":"Mengumpulkan data dengan turus dan tabel, membaca dan membuat piktogram serta diagram batang, dan menarik kesimpulan yang wajar.","objectives":["mencatat data dengan turus dan tabel","membaca dan membuat piktogram","membaca dan membuat diagram batang","membandingkan data dan menarik kesimpulan yang wajar"],"sections":[{"id":"tabel","title":"Turus dan tabel","html":"\n      <p>Saat menghitung, tulis satu garis untuk setiap data. Setiap kelompok lima ditulis empat garis tegak dicoret satu garis miring, supaya mudah dihitung. Hasilnya dipindahkan ke tabel.</p>\n      <table><tr><th>Buah favorit</th><th>Apel</th><th>Jeruk</th><th>Mangga</th></tr><tr><td>Banyak siswa</td><td>8</td><td>5</td><td>11</td></tr></table>"},{"id":"piktogram","title":"Piktogram","html":"\n      <figure class=\"lesson-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 172\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Piktogram penanaman pohon\"><text x=\"10\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">Kelas 4A</text><g transform=\"translate(110 14)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(146 14)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(182 14)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(218 14)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><text x=\"10\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">Kelas 4B</text><g transform=\"translate(110 58)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(146 58)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(182 58)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(218 58)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(254 58)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(290 58)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><text x=\"10\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">Kelas 4C</text><g transform=\"translate(110 102)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(146 102)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(182 102)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(218 102)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(254 102)\"><path d=\"M14 2 L26 22 H2Z\" fill=\"#5a9b5e\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"22\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#8c5a3c\"/></g><text x=\"10\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#6b6f80\">Keterangan: 1 gambar pohon = 3 pohon</text></svg></figure>\n      <p>Selalu baca keterangannya. Jika 1 gambar = 3 pohon, maka 6 gambar = 18 pohon. Setengah gambar berarti setengah dari 3.</p>"},{"id":"batang","title":"Diagram batang","html":"\n      <figure class=\"lesson-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagram batang sampah plastik per hari\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#ece7dc\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6b6f80\">0</text><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#ece7dc\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6b6f80\">5</text><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#ece7dc\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6b6f80\">10</text><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#ece7dc\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6b6f80\">15</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"56\" width=\"44\" height=\"144\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">Sen</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">12</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"92\" width=\"44\" height=\"108\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0f8a7e\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text x=\"172\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">Sel</text><text x=\"172\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">9</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"20\" width=\"44\" height=\"180\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#c47a0e\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">Rab</text><text x=\"252\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">15</text><rect x=\"310\" y=\"128\" width=\"44\" height=\"72\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#c2414f\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text x=\"332\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">Kam</text><text x=\"332\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">6</text></svg></figure>\n      <p>Tinggi batang menunjukkan banyaknya. Baca dengan menarik garis lurus dari ujung batang ke sumbu tegak. Dari diagram di atas, sampah plastik paling banyak pada hari Rabu.</p>"},{"id":"simpulan","title":"Menarik kesimpulan","html":"\n      <p>Data dari 5 teman belum tentu menggambarkan seluruh sekolah, apalagi seluruh Indonesia. Kesimpulan yang wajar menyebut dari mana datanya berasal, misalnya \"di kelas kami\".</p>"}]}